sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Browser
    participant ALB as Application Load Balancer
    participant WP as WordPress on EC2
    participant Cache as Valkey cache
    participant DB as RDS MySQL
    participant EFS as EFS uploads

    User->>ALB: HTTP request on port 80
    ALB->>WP: Forward to a healthy target
    WP-->>Cache: Look up cached object/session
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>WP: Cached value
    else Cache miss or cache not configured
        WP->>DB: Query WordPress data on port 3306
        DB-->>WP: Posts, settings, and metadata
        WP-->>Cache: Store reusable result
    end
    opt Request needs uploaded media
        WP->>EFS: Read shared upload over NFS
        EFS-->>WP: Media file
    end
    WP-->>ALB: Generated page or asset
    ALB-->>User: HTTP response
